CM_ BO_ 2147713030 "Fault bitfield";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Rectifier_overtemperature "This flag is asserted when the temperature of the Rectifier block is too high.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Phase_W_overcurrent "Indicates an overcurrent event on Phase U. The overcurrent event is triggered when the measured phase current is over the programmed current limit.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Phase_V_overcurrent "Indicates an overcurrent event on Phase U. The overcurrent event is triggered when the measured phase current is over the programmed current limit.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Phase_U_overcurrent "Indicates an overcurrent event on Phase U. The overcurrent event is triggered when the measured phase current is over the programmed current limit.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Ground_fault "A ground fault has been detected.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 EEPROM_failure "The configuration EEPROM failed to load or save the module configuration.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Measurement_system_failure "The voltages/currents measurement system is malfunctionning, and readouts are not guaranteed to be accurate.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Control_response_timedout "The control system did not answer within the allowed time window, and a time out condition was triggered. The converter is switched off as the control system is not present.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 CAN_failure "CAN bus or transceiver not operating properly.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Voltage_loop_failure "The voltage loop is not operational, and therefore voltage regulation is not guaranteed.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Current_loop_failure "The current loop is not operational, and therefore current regulation is not guaranteed.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Switching_failure "Failure in the MOSFET block or in their drivers.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Current_sharing_failure "A failure in the internal current sharing. The operation up to the nominal output current cannot be guaranteed.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Transformer_overtemperature "This flag is asserted when the temperature of the Transformer block is too high.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 MOSFET_overtemperature "This flag is asserted when the temperature of the MOSFET block is too high.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Input_undervoltage "Input undervoltage condition. The undervoltage condition is asserted when the measured input voltage is under the programmed voltage limit.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Input_overvoltage "Input overvoltage condition. The overvoltage condition is asserted when the measured input voltage is over the programmed voltage limit.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Output_undervoltage "Output undervoltage condition. The undervoltage condition is asserted when the measured output voltage is under the programmed voltage limit.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Output_overvoltage "Indicates an output overvoltage event. The overvoltage event is triggered when the measured output voltage is over the programmed voltage limit.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Output_overcurrent "Indicates an output overcurrent event. The overcurrent event is triggered when the measured output current is over the programmed current limit.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Protection_trip_external "This flag is asserted if the interlock is open due to an external condition received in the module.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713030 Protection_trip_internal "This flagg is asserted if the interlock is open due to an internal fault condition (self-protection)";
CM_ BO_ 2147713031 "Status bitfield";
CM_ SG_ 2147713031 PWM_v2_mode "Indicates if the converter is in PWM v2 mode, and therefore working in open loop.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713031 PFC_voltage_loop_mode "Indicates id the pfc voltage loop mode is enabled.";
CM_ SG_ 2147713031 PFC_current_loop_mode "Indicates id the pfc current loop mode is enabled.";
